ardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}),P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P=(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}),P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (countable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\in}\">\\(\\prec_{\\in}\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMasterCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMasterCondition}_S\\)</span> (master-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1f389a6045b620f7\" href=\"?note=1f389a6045b620f7\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-master-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-master-condition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ProperMasterCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ProperMasterCondition}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}proper\\text{-}master\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ProperMasterCondition}_S(M,\\mathbb P,p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\theta)=\\theta\\land\\omega&lt;\\theta\\land M\\prec_{\\in}H_\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMasterCondition}_S(p,M,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}proper\\text{-}master\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ProperMasterCondition}_S(M,\\mathbb P,p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\theta)=\\theta\\land\\omega&lt;\\theta\\land M\\prec_{\\in}H_\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMasterCondition}_S(p,M,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper-masterhood now reuses the canonical master-condition predicate and formally requires a countable elementary submodel of a regular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The condition carrier and order are unpacked from the poset argument inside the predicate rather than inherited as hidden ambient components.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"